{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738380/extras/954a7045c6f0e3fcd9c1209816ca77b8.poster.avif?t=1772275025\" width=626 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738380/extras/954a7045c6f0e3fcd9c1209816ca77b8.webm?t=1772275025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738380/extras/954a7045c6f0e3fcd9c1209816ca77b8.mp4?t=1772275025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Quiz</strong> is a fast-paced, competitive multiplayer quiz game for 2\u20136 players. But this isn\u2019t your average trivia night. Knowledge alone isn\u2019t enough here\u2014you\u2019ll need strategy, cunning, and a pinch of chaos magic to outwit your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't know the answer? No problem!. If you're clever with your skills, you can steal the win\u2014literally. Outplay your opponents, protect your lead, or drag others down with you. Victory isn\u2019t always fair, and that\u2019s the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful skills to increase your points, sabotage other players' answers, or even reverse their scores! The twist? Everyone sees what everyone else is doing\u2026 so trust no one, and answer fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOT A REGULAR QUIZ</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738380/extras/cd4b3b8c2134d52f69342a8f38b090d7.poster.avif?t=1772275025\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738380/extras/cd4b3b8c2134d52f69342a8f38b090d7.webm?t=1772275025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738380/extras/cd4b3b8c2134d52f69342a8f38b090d7.mp4?t=1772275025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer with text, not guesses.</strong> No multiple choice\u2014type the answer and watch the chaos unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Skills:</strong> Disrupt others or empower yourself with game-changing abilities like:<br><strong>See What Others Answer:</strong> Analyse rival answers in real-time and use that against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Points Matter, Timing Matters More:</strong> The faster you answer correctly, the more points you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Lobbies:</strong> Host sessions, vote on categories, and toggle cooldowns for chaotic custom gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-to-Play:</strong> No upfront cost, just good vibes and even better rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics &amp; Question Packs:</strong> Unlock new looks and quiz sets with optional purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EASY TO PLAY</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the question.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type your answer and use skills before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how your friends tried to sabotage you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh or rage at the results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat\u2014with more tricks up your sleeve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOIN THE QUIZ REVOLUTION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can outsmart your friends and the chaos? Wishlist now and prepare for the ultimate battle of brains and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgro